{"id":"n25159-2-8","stage":2,"title":"일부러 · 故意地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25159-2-8-1","ko":"와, 이번 게임은 내가 이겼다!","zh":"哇，这次游戏是我赢啦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦。","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"게임은","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게임은","audio":"/audio/d9cf83882979e4b0cbec.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"이겼다!","meaning":"赢，战胜，打败","explanation":"이기다：赢，战胜，打败；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"이기다","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71688","senseId":"1","lemma":"이기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이겼다","audio":"/audio/434daa8d6e73f28562dd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/